step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>Go to the house west of the <col=800000>The Cloak and Stagger</col> tavern in <col=800000>Shayzien</col>. (<col=800000>Xeric's Talisman</col> - 1. Xeric's Lookout and run north-west, or Fairy Ring DJR)</col>
step	2	-	Quick guide step 2
line	<str>Go to the house west of the The Cloak and Stagger tavern in Shayzien. (Xeric's Talisman - 1. Xeric's Lookout and run north-west, or Fairy Ring DJR)</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Speak to <col=800000>Phileas Rimor</col>, and agree to help him.</col>
step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>Go to the house west of the The Cloak and Stagger tavern in Shayzien. (Xeric's Talisman - 1. Xeric's Lookout and run north-west, or Fairy Ring DJR)</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Phileas Rimor, and agree to help him.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Gather a ranged weapon, a melee weapon (a pickaxe counts as a valid melee weapon), and runes to perform any magic attack if you have not already.</col>
