line	<str>Travel to the summit of Mount Quidamortem. (Lovakengj Minecart Network or Xeric's Talisman - 5. Xeric's Honour if it is unlocked) or Fairy ring BLS (if unlocked)</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Historian Duffy. (near the water symbol on the minimap)</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a rope on the crevice on the western side of the mountain, and enter the crevice. Go around to the south, not through the middle. (near the ! symbol on minimap)</str>
line	
line	<str>Mine the Boulder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Push the Boulder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Attempt to pass the magic gate, and kill the Corrupt Lizardman.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pass through the magic gate and inspect the Unstable Altar.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Hop worlds after you finish the dialogue to quickly leave the cave.</col>
step	20	-	Quick guide step 20
line	<str>Go to the house west of the The Cloak and Stagger tavern in Shayzien. (Xeric's Talisman - 1. Xeric's Lookout and run north-west, or Fairy Ring DJR)</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Phileas Rimor, and agree to help him.</str>
line	
line	<str>Gather a ranged weapon, a melee weapon (a pickaxe counts as a valid melee weapon), and runes to perform any magic attack if you have not already.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Arceuus Library (Fairy ring CIS or Lovakengj Minecart Network) and speak to Archeio to teleport to the Library Historical Archive.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Pagida, and agree to be teleported into the Tower of Magic prison.</str>
line	
line	<str>Push the strange device all the way west. From the north side, attack the device using magic.</str>
line	
line	<str>From the south side, attack using melee. (Note: Make sure your NPC attack options are not set to hidden, or the Attack option will not appear!)</str>
line	
line	<str>Push the strange device all the way east. From the south side, attack using ranged.</str>
line	
line	<str>Investigate the skeleton in the northern cell.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the quest start and talk to Phileas Rimor (Xeric's Talisman - 1. Xeric's Lookout and run north-west).</str>
line	
line	<str>Go north-west to the War Tent in the south-west corner of the Shayzien Encampment. Go upstairs and speak to Lord Shiro Shayzien.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel to the summit of Mount Quidamortem. (Lovakengj Minecart Network or Xeric's Talisman - 5. Xeric's Honour if it is unlocked) or Fairy ring BLS (if unlocked)</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Historian Duffy. (near the water symbol on the minimap)</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a rope on the crevice on the western side of the mountain, and enter the crevice. Go around to the south, not through the middle. (near the ! symbol on minimap)</str>
line	
line	<str>Mine the Boulder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Push the Boulder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Attempt to pass the magic gate, and kill the Corrupt Lizardman.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pass through the magic gate and inspect the Unstable Altar.</str>
line	
line	<str>Hop worlds after you finish the dialogue to quickly leave the cave.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Speak to Historian Duffy again.</col>
